              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "marthacook"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is my go-to method for quick salmon filets or steaks. I use butter not oil and add sliced fresh garlic to the cast iron pan while cooking. Flavour! Goes with all side dishes.",
